1
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,160
At the left

2
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:23,400
we can see, at the right we can see
the head snarlers, and everything is safe,

3
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,440
perfectly safe.
Emo?

4
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,440
Emo.

5
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,760
Watch out!

6
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,900
Are you hurt?

7
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:53,940
I don't think so.
You?

8
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:56,820
I'm okay.

9
00:00:57,740 --> 00:01:01,220
Get up, Emo.
It's not safe here.

10
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:03,260
Let's go.

11
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:04,640
What's next?

12
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:07,380
You'll see.

13
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:09,020
You'll see.

14
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:17,920
Emo,
this way.

15
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:35,660
Follow me!

16
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:12,320
Hurry, Emo!

17
00:02:21,580 --> 00:02:23,000
Listen, listen.
Listen.

18
00:02:48,660 --> 00:02:50,308
You're not paying attention.

19
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:53,900
I just want to answer the phone.

20
00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:57,200
Emo, look,
I mean, listen.

21
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,960
You have to learn to listen.

22
00:03:03,460 --> 00:03:05,540
This is not some game.
You,

23
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:09,160
I mean,
we could easily die out here.

24
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:11,180
Listen.

25
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:14,020
Listen to the sounds of the machine.

26
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,751
Listen to your breathing.

27
00:04:26,980 --> 00:04:29,275
Well, don't you ever get tired of this?

28
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:30,700
Tired?

29
00:04:31,420 --> 00:04:32,760
Emo, the machine is

30
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:37,080
like clockwork.
One move out of place

31
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,980
and you're ground to a pulp.

32
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:46,220
But isn't there like pulp, Emo?
Is that what you want, pulp?

33
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:49,720
Emo,
your goal in life?

34
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:51,860
Pulp?

35
00:05:41,580 --> 00:05:43,320
Emo,
close your eyes.

36
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,720
Why? Now.

37
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:54,220
Okay. Good.

38
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:02,525
What do you see at your left side,
Emo? Well...

39
00:06:04,384 --> 00:06:05,464
Nothing, really.

40
00:06:06,684 --> 00:06:07,802
No, nothing at all,

41
00:06:07,844 --> 00:06:09,784
really.
And at your right,

42
00:06:09,924 --> 00:06:12,277
what do you see at your right side, Emo?

43
00:06:13,784 --> 00:06:14,784
The same, Proog.

44
00:06:15,864 --> 00:06:16,864
Exactly the same.

45
00:06:17,084 --> 00:06:19,004
Nothing.
Great.

46
00:06:40,644 --> 00:06:42,564
Listen, Proog, do you hear that?

47
00:06:43,664 --> 00:06:44,664
Can we go here?

48
00:06:45,584 --> 00:06:46,004
There?

49
00:06:46,004 --> 00:06:48,024
Yeah,
it isn't safe, Emo.

50
00:06:49,644 --> 00:06:50,644
Well, but

51
00:06:50,684 --> 00:06:52,024
trust me, it's not.

52
00:06:53,284 --> 00:06:54,696
Well maybe I could go...

53
00:06:54,724 --> 00:06:55,724
No.

54
00:06:57,444 --> 00:06:58,084
But...

55
00:06:58,084 --> 00:06:59,044
No!

56
00:06:59,444 --> 00:07:00,444
No!

57
00:07:01,284 --> 00:07:03,124
Any further questions, Emo?

58
00:07:04,604 --> 00:07:05,604
No.

59
00:07:09,884 --> 00:07:10,884
Emo.

60
00:07:10,904 --> 00:07:11,824
Yeah.

61
00:07:11,824 --> 00:07:12,824
Emo, why?

62
00:07:13,824 --> 00:07:15,204
Emo,
why?

63
00:07:15,604 --> 00:07:18,324
Why can't you see
the beauty of this place?

64
00:07:19,104 --> 00:07:20,544
The way it works,

65
00:07:21,864 --> 00:07:23,524
